AB  - We analyse the WTI Spot oil price from January 3, 1986 to September 20, 2024, as well as the Europe Brent Spot oil price from May 15, 1987, to 20, 2024. We present the most recent data for the weekly WTI Spot OP for 2024, which is approximately 75–80 US /b, and the weekly Europe Brent Spot OP, which is approximately 80–85 US /b. The optimal hybrid model for the weekly WTI Spot OP is ARMA-GARCH-MLP (5, 6, 1) with ARMA (3, 0) and GARCH (1, 1). On the other hand, the optimal hybrid model for the weekly Europe Brent Spot OP is ARMA-GARCH-MLP (6, 3, 1) with ARMA (3, 1) and GARCH (1, 1). These hybrid models provide forecasted values ranging from 53.8105 US /b to 72.2258 US /b for WTI and from 69.575 US /b to 76.1401 US /b for Europe Brent, thus aligning the most recent data with IEA forecasting outcomes. © 2025 The Authors.
